value:
Cannot call text element methods using the result from .draw()
This can occur in two situations:
  1. scribble().draw().method();
  2. t = scribble().draw(); t.method()

Instead use:
  1. scribble().method().draw();
  2. t = scribble(); t.method(); t.draw();

